{%- assign nc_ctitle = collection.title | default: 'All Products' -%}
{%- assign nc_ch = collection.handle | default: 'shop-all' -%}
{% comment %}v3 (Juice): 'Each one is drug-free' (was 'Every one' — read as a misspelling); massage-recovery uses a colon instead of an em-dash; the Shop All / default description rewritten DASH-FREE (too many stacked dashes when wrapped). KEEP IN SYNC with COLLDESC/COLLDEF in sections/nc-cro.liquid — its collDescFix() re-asserts this copy client-side over nc-pdp2's overwrite. v2: per-collection pain-point copy + pain badges, broken Show more removed, Shop M&R CTA removed.{% endcomment %}
<section class="nc-collhero" aria-label="Collection intro">
  <div class="nc-ed">
    <span class="nc-ed__eye">North Cove Wellness</span>
    <h1 class="nc-ed__h1">{{ nc_ctitle }}</h1>
    <p class="nc-ed__sub">Therapy-grade comfort and relief for everyday life.</p>
    <div class="nc-ed__desc open" id="ncDesc{{ section.id }}">
      {% comment %}2026-09-23: returns removed site-wide by owner request{% endcomment %}
      {%- case nc_ch -%}
      {%- when 'best-sellers' -%}
      <p>These are the tools our customers reach for most — for mornings that start stiff, necks and shoulders wrecked by desk work, backs that ache by dinner, and legs that feel like lead after a long day on your feet. Each one is drug-free, built for home, and ships with free tracked US shipping.</p>
      {%- when 'massage-recovery-1' -%}
      <p>Deep knots that stretching can’t reach. Soreness that hangs around for days after a workout. Tension that creeps back the week after every massage appointment. This collection is built to fix exactly that: percussion, kneading, heat and compression tools that work the ache out at home, with free tracked US shipping.</p>
      {%- else -%}
      <p>Whatever ache brought you here, this collection has a drug-free tool built to fix it: stiff necks from screens, lower backs that complain by evening, achy knees on the stairs, and heavy, tired legs. Every item ships free with tracking.</p>
      {%- endcase -%}
    </div>
    <div class="nc-ed__img{% if nc_ch == 'summer-sale' %} nc-ed__img--full{% endif %}">{%- if nc_ch == 'summer-sale' -%}<img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0815/5706/1860/files/SUMMER_SALE.png?v=1784764131" alt="North Cove Wellness Summer Sale, up to 37% off all massage and recovery tools" loading="eager">{%- elsif nc_ch == 'best-sellers' and section.settings.lifestyle_image -%}<img src="{{ section.settings.lifestyle_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="{{ nc_ctitle | escape }}">{%- elsif collection.image -%}<img src="{{ collection.image | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="{{ nc_ctitle | escape }}">{%- elsif request.path == '/collections/all' and section.settings.all_image -%}<img src="{{ section.settings.all_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="{{ nc_ctitle | escape }}">{%- elsif section.settings.lifestyle_image -%}<img src="{{ section.settings.lifestyle_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="{{ nc_ctitle | escape }}">{%- else -%}<span>Lifestyle image</span>{%- endif -%}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="nc-rot" id="ncRot{{ section.id }}" aria-label="Highlights">
    <div class="nc-rot__track">
      <div class="nc-rot__slide on">Therapy-Grade Wellness, Curated For Daily Comfort</div>
      {% comment %}2026-09-23: returns removed site-wide by owner request{% endcomment %}
      <div class="nc-rot__slide">Free 5-Pack Resistance Bands With Every Order</div>
      <div class="nc-rot__slide">Real US-Based Support, 1 To 2 Day Replies</div>
    </div>
    <div class="nc-rot__dots">
      <span class="nc-rot__dot on" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Slide 1"></span>
      <span class="nc-rot__dot" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Slide 2"></span>
      <span class="nc-rot__dot" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Slide 3"></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="nc-promo">
    <div class="nc-promo__media">{%- if section.settings.promo_image -%}<img src="{{ section.settings.promo_image | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="North Cove Wellness">{%- else -%}<span>Brand image / AI video</span>{%- endif -%}</div>
    <div class="nc-promo__body">
      <span class="nc-promo__eye">Built for real aches</span>
      {%- case nc_ch -%}
      {%- when 'best-sellers' -%}
      <h2 class="nc-promo__head">Relief for the aches you live with every day</h2>
      {%- when 'massage-recovery-1' -%}
      <h2 class="nc-promo__head">Made for muscles that won’t let go</h2>
      {%- else -%}
      <h2 class="nc-promo__head">Drug-free relief for every ache</h2>
      {%- endcase -%}
      {% comment %}2026-09-23: returns removed site-wide by owner request{% endcomment %}
      <p class="nc-promo__sub">Therapy-grade, drug-free tools chosen for how they feel in real life — with free tracked shipping.</p>
      <div class="nc-promo__badges">
      {%- case nc_ch -%}
      {%- when 'best-sellers' -%}
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Morning stiffness</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='4.5'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='1' fill='currentColor'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Neck &amp; shoulder tension</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Backs that ache by evening</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M2 12h4l2.5-7 4.5 14 3-9 1.5 2h4.5'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Tired, heavy legs</span></div>
      {%- when 'massage-recovery-1' -%}
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='4.5'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='1' fill='currentColor'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Knots that stretching can’t reach</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M2 12h4l2.5-7 4.5 14 3-9 1.5 2h4.5'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Post-workout soreness</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Tension that keeps returning</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9'/><path d='M12 7v5l3 2'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Aches that wreck your sleep</span></div>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Stiff necks &amp; shoulders</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Sore, aching backs</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='4.5'/><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='1' fill='currentColor'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Achy knees &amp; joints</span></div>
        <div class="nc-promo__badge"><span class="nc-promo__ic"><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M2 12h4l2.5-7 4.5 14 3-9 1.5 2h4.5'/></svg></span><span class="nc-promo__lab">Heavy legs &amp; feet</span></div>
      {%- endcase -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
